# Terraform state — plain text, may hold secrets read back from AWS
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform.tfstate.lock.info

# Working directory created by `terraform init`
.terraform/

# Variable values — where secrets usually leak in a public repo
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json

# Crash logs and local override files
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl does NOT belong here — it must be committed.
# It pins the provider hash. Without it the CI may pull a different version
# and the plan diverges from what was tested.

# Local AI tooling instructions
/CLAUDE.md

# Docs
/docs/
